  ($str$variable$str$, 'USA', $str$2026-Forging$str$, $str$usePreferredMachines$str$, $str$true$str$, NULL, $str$If true the model will first try to select a preferred machine. If false, the system chooses either the default machine or from the entire non-preferred set of machines.$str$, $jsonb${"Variable Name":"usePreferredMachines","String Value":true,"Unit Type Name":null,"Notes":"If true the model will first try to select a preferred machine. If false, the system chooses either the default machine or from the entire non-preferred set of machines.","Section":"Inherited","Deprecated":"No"}$jsonb$::jsonb),
